1
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:30,000
Adventure awaits.

2
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:54,000
Spirit Untamed is a animation, adventure, family film directed by Elaine Bogan.

3
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:18,000
Lucky Prescott's life is changed forever when she moves from her home in the city
to a small frontier town and befriends a wild mustang named Spirit.

4
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:42,000
Lucky Prescott (voice), played by Isabela Merced.

5
00:22:00,000 --> 00:22:06,000
Aunt Cora (voice), played by Julianne Moore.

6
00:26:24,000 --> 00:26:30,000
Prudence Granger (voice), played by Marsai Martin.

7
00:30:48,000 --> 00:30:54,000
Abigail Stone (voice), played by Mckenna Grace.

8
00:35:12,000 --> 00:35:18,000
Hendricks (voice), played by Walton Goggins.

9
00:39:36,000 --> 00:39:42,000
Jim Prescott (voice), played by Jake Gyllenhaal.

10
00:44:00,000 --> 00:44:06,000
Spirit Untamed is a 2021 American animated Western musical comedy adventure film
directed by Elaine Bogan and written by Aury Wallington and Kristin Hahn.

11
00:48:24,000 --> 00:48:30,000
The second theatrical film of the Spirit franchise, it is a soft reboot of Spirit: Stallion of the
Cimarron (2002) and is based on characters from Netflix spin-off series, Spirit Riding Free.

12
00:52:48,000 --> 00:52:54,000
With the voices of Isabela Merced, Jake Gyllenhaal, Marsai Martin, Mckenna Grace, Julianne Moore, Walton Goggins, and Andre Braugher, the film is about a
young girl named Fortuna "Lucky" Prescott who moves to the small rural community of Miradero, where she meets the titular wild kiger mustang.

13
00:57:12,000 --> 00:57:18,000
As the son of Spirit and Rain from Spirit: Stallion of the Cimarron, she names the horse
"Spirit" after his father, and Lucky immediately begins to bond with him.

14
01:01:36,000 --> 01:01:42,000
The film was announced to be in development in October 2019, and
production was done remotely during the COVID-19 pandemic.

15
01:06:00,000 --> 01:06:06,000
The film was dedicated to the memory of Kelly Asbury, the co-director
of the original Spirit film, who died on June 26, 2020.

16
01:10:24,000 --> 01:10:30,000
Spirit Untamed was theatrically released in the United
States on June 4, 2021, by Universal Pictures.

17
01:14:48,000 --> 01:14:54,000
The film received mixed reviews from critics who deemed the film inferior to the
original and unnecessary, though its animation and humor was praised.

18
01:19:12,000 --> 01:19:18,000
The film underperformed at the box-office, grossing over $42 million worldwide against a budget of $30
million, making it both DreamWorks Animation's cheapest and lowest-grossing film to date.

19
01:23:36,000 --> 01:23:42,000
The film explores themes of horse, mustang, female
protagonist, animals, wild horse.
